			"notes": "All notable changes to pixelReel are documented here.\n\n## [2.0.0] — 2026-09-16\n\nFirst NeoForge release for **Minecraft 1.21.1**.\n\nRequires **NeoForge 21.1.250+**, **Java 21**, and **64-bit VLC** on each client that should see video. Dedicated servers must also open **TCP 25567** (`mediaProxyPort`) next to 25565.\n\n### Added\n\n- Six craftable displays: Compact TV (3×2), Wall TV (6×4), Ultrawide Monitor (8×4), Cinema Screen (14×8), Curved Cinema Screen (16×7), Giant Cinema Screen (20×10)\n- Live TV from Tunarr or any M3U + XMLTV playlist, with now/next guide\n- On-demand movies and shows from **Jellyfin**, **Emby**, and **Plex**, including in-game config GUIs\n- Server-side media proxy so API keys and Plex tokens never reach clients or world saves\n- Server-authoritative multiplayer sync (power, channel/title, volume, playback position, late join)\n- Playback controls: power, pause/resume, volume, channel/media select, autoplay next episode\n- Subtitles, letterboxing (no stretch), and HDR tone mapping\n- Positional audio and `/tv zone` theatre audio zones\n- Pixel Glasses fullscreen overlay of a nearby playing screen\n- Movie Poster (2×3) and Huge Movie Poster (up to 10×15) with library art, currently-watching binding, and custom png/jpg/gif\n- `/tv` command suite for menu, channels, guide, playback, rebuild, zones, and provider status\n- Permission rules (`everyone` / `op` / name lists) plus LuckPerms-compatible nodes — players do not need operator status to watch\n- pixelReel creative tab; all displays, posters, and glasses are craftable"
		},
