			"notes": "First public release of pixelReel for Minecraft  1.21.1 (Fabric).\nWhat's included\n\n    Placeable screens (Compact, Wall, Ultra wide, Cinema, Curved screens)\n    Live TV via Tunarr / M3U + XMLTV\n    Jellyfin, Emby, Plex integration\n    Poster browse UI\n    playback controls, console commands\n    Multiplayer sync (server-authoritative)\n    Pixel Glasses overlay\n    Client VLC video + positional audio\n\nRequirements\n\n    Java 25+\n    Minecraft 26.3-snapshot-5\n    Fabric Loader ≥ 0.19.3\n    Fabric API matching 26.3\n    64-bit VLC on each client (for video)\n\nInstall\n\n    Install Fabric for 26.3-snapshot-5\n    Add Fabric API + pixelreel-1.0.0.jar to mods\n    Install VLC on clients\n\nCheck out the README for setup instructions Repo: https://github.com/Samarth-programming/PixelReel_1.21.1\n\nFixed\n\nCrash when opening an on-demand category: OutOfMemoryError: Out of stack space while loading thumbnails\nUI hitching / freeze when flipping pages or loading many posters at once\nChanged\n\nBrowse UI keeps one page of posters in memory and clears the previous page on page/search change\nSearch requests are debounced\nImproved\n\nNotes for testers\n\nReplace the old pixelreel-1.0.0.jar with a newly built jar"
